<title>CANADA: HORSE RACING-ALPHABET SOUP WINS BREEDERS' CUP CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-ALPHABET SOUP WINS BREEDERS' CUP CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alphabet Soup won the $3</p>
<p>million Breeders' Cup Classic at Woodbine Racetrack on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Louis Quatorze finished second, with Cigar third.</p>
</text>
